### Get users
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Accept: application/json

### Get user by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/2
Accept: application/json

### Create user
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ada Lovelace",
  "email": "ada@example.com"
}

### Patch user
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ada.updated@example.com"
}

### Not found on purpose
GET {{baseUrl}}/this-path-does-not-exist
